  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Buzaaya Coffee Processing and Marketing Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Coffee .Beneficiaries: 3258 smallholder farmers of whom 915 are women .Project funds will be used to provide storage facilities to increase the organizations capacity to bulk large volumes coffee; procure a truck for delivery of coffee from farmers to central warehouse; and for working capital to pay farmers on delivery as well as procure quality inputs for farmers.</narrative>
  </description>
